data: {"type":"data-vendo-build-failed","data":{"toolCallId":"hcall_10_ee5a74f9-a17c-40c5-af8f-b4a161eaa1b4","reason":"app build failed: This app wasn't created, because it didn't pass the checks that keep an app honest: This stat uses count(items.data) — the total count of all items — instead of filtering for pending/open records; every item in the data has status \"active\", so this number is wrong and misleading; it should filter items.data to only rows where status equals a pending/open value before counting."}}

